(1) The annual contribution under § 12b of the Restrukturierungsfondsgesetz for institutions within the meaning of § 2 sentence 1 point 2 of the Restrukturierungsfondsgesetz that are investment firms within the meaning of Article 96(1)(a) or (b) of Regulation (EU) No 575/2013 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 26 June 2013 on prudential requirements for credit institutions and investment firms and amending Regulation (EU) No 646/2012 (OJ L 176, 27.6.2013, p. 1), or that carry on the activity referred to in point (8) of Section A of Annex I to Directive 2004/39/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 21 April 2004 on markets in financial instruments amending Council Directives 85/611/EEC and 93/6/EEC and Directive 2000/12/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council and repealing Council Directive 93/22/EEC (OJ L 145, 30.4.2004, p. 1) but not the activities referred to in points (3) and (6) of Section A of Annex I to that Directive, is calculated in accordance with subsection (3).

(2) The annual contribution under § 12b of the Restrukturierungsfondsgesetz for institutions within the meaning of § 2 sentence 1 point 3 of the Restrukturierungsfondsgesetz is calculated in accordance with subsection (3).

(3) The annual contribution of the institutions referred to in subsections (1) and (2) is calculated as follows:
1. institutions whose total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63 of 21 October 2014 supplementing Directive 2014/59/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council with regard to ex ante contributions to resolution financing arrangements (OJ L 11, 17.1.2015, p. 44), less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, amount to no more than EUR 50 million must pay a lump sum of EUR 1,000 as annual contribution for each contribution period;
2. institutions whose total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, amount to more than EUR 50 million and no more than EUR 100 million must pay a lump sum of EUR 2,000 as annual contribution for each contribution period;
3. institutions whose total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, amount to more than EUR 100 million and no more than EUR 150 million must pay a lump sum of EUR 7,000 as annual contribution for each contribution period;
4. institutions whose total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, amount to more than EUR 150 million and no more than EUR 200 million must pay a lump sum of EUR 15,000 as annual contribution for each contribution period;
5. institutions whose total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, amount to more than EUR 200 million and no more than EUR 250 million must pay a lump sum of EUR 26,000 as annual contribution for each contribution period;
6. institutions whose total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, amount to more than EUR 250 million and no more than EUR 300 million must pay a lump sum of EUR 50,000 as annual contribution for each contribution period;
7. institutions whose total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, amount to more than EUR 300 million must pay as annual contribution for each contribution period
a) a lump sum of EUR 50,000 and
b) in addition, EUR 25,000 for each EUR 100 million or part thereof by which total liabilities within the meaning of point (11) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, less own funds within the meaning of subsections (4) and (5) and covered deposits within the meaning of point (10) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63, exceed EUR 300 million.
The annual contribution under sentence 1 is calculated on the basis of the reference year of the annual accounts referred to in Article 14(1) of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63. Article 13(5) of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63 applies accordingly.

(4) In calculating the contributions under subsection (3) for the institutions referred to in subsection (1), own funds are determined in accordance with point (16) of the second sentence of Article 3 of Delegated Regulation (EU) No 2015/63. § 3(1) and (4) apply accordingly to the determination of own funds under sentence 1.

(5) In calculating the contributions under subsection (3) for the institutions referred to in subsection (2), own funds are determined in accordance with § 53(2) point 4 of the Kreditwesengesetz in the version applicable for the reference year under subsection (3). In determining the liabilities under subsection (3), half of a net liability settlement balance is disregarded. § 3(1) and (2) apply accordingly to the determination of covered deposits under subsection (3).

